results.description:
Dossen International Group is one of China’s leading hospitality management companies, with portfolio that includes over 1000 operational properties across 200 different cities in China, several hotels in Malaysia and more new hotels rapidly being developed worldwide.

As one of the global top 32 hotel groups, Dossen International is the first Chinese hotel group to take select-service hotel as its core development strategy. Founded in 2006, Dossen International is governed by the corporate values of: Customer-oriented, Result-oriented, Passion and Focus, Cooperation and Sharing.  The group by its continuous product improvement and development aims to provide perfect lodging experience for the travelers worldwide.

Dossen International combines the expertise of a truly global management team with hospitality excellence, for which Asia is renowned.

Group prides itself on an open, approachable leadership style and recognizes that property partners are the fundamental basis for the success of any hotel management company. Their needs and concerns are our driving force.

Dossen offers a wide portfolio of inspiring hospitality brands that give owners clear path to profitability, including: 

EASSEN – a high-end business hotel brand; 
ECHARM – a standard mid-scale hotel brand; 
CITTEL – a leading high-end economy hotel brand; 
JTOUR Inn- a featured business hotel brand; 
BORRMAN – a featured mid-and-high-end business hotel brand; 
NICE TO MEET YOU – a mid-and-high-end life-style hotel brand; 
IMMERSING – a mid-and-high-end immersing resort hotel brand; 
POLTON – a mid-and-high-end service apartment brand.

Today, Dossen International reaches beyond our Chinese roots to offer innovative, stylish and convenient hotel brands across Southeast Asia, Asia Pacific, Indian Ocean, Arabian Gulf and Europe.

To illuminate the road of dreams.

